---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Visits
permalink: /visits/
---
<div class="text">
    <h1>Visits</h1>
    <p>Since our first choir camp at Salisbury in 1991, we have sung services at {{ collections.cathedrals | sungCount }} cathedrals and abbeys around England. Most years we spend a week in August as the visiting choir at a cathedral, and we also sing for one-off services. You can also <a href="/cathedrals/">browse our visits by cathedral</a>.</p>
</div>

{% include "partials/upcoming.njk" %}

{% if collections.upcoming.length %}<h2>Past visits</h2>{% endif %}
<ol class="visit-list">
{%- for visit in collections.visits %}
    <li{% if visit.data.status %} class="is-{{ visit.data.status | slugify }}"{% endif %}>
        <span class="visit-year">{{ visit.data | visitYear }}</span>
        <a href="{{ visit.url }}" class="visit-name">{{ visit.data.cathedral | smart }}</a>
        <span class="visit-detail">
            {%- if visit.data.start or visit.data.month %}{{ visit.data | visitDates }}{% endif %}
            {%- if (visit.data.start or visit.data.month) and visit.data.kind %} · {% endif %}{{ visit.data.kind | smart }}
            {%- if visit.data.status %} · <span class="status">{{ visit.data.status | smart }}</span>{% endif %}
        </span>
    </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
